{:doc ["New-DSL conversion of ac/vfx/effects/beam_arc_fade.edn (S6). CORRECTED"
        "from an earlier pass in this same session that wrongly treated this"
        "whole file as dead: :vfx/beam-arc-fade is NOT a plain leaf component"
        "(unlike this pass's other \"confirmed-dead\" files) -- it is a"
        "COMPOSITE (vfx-core/composites/beam_arc_fade.edn), and"
        "final_catalog.clj's load-vfx calls vfx_system_compiler/expand-graph"
        "BEFORE sampling, inlining the composite's real body (a :vfx/beam, a"
        "dead :vfx/arc-field, and a :vfx/fade-wrapped :vfx/ring) in place of"
        "the single :vfx/beam-arc-fade reference. sample-node never sees the"
        "keyword :vfx/beam-arc-fade at all -- it only ever samples the"
        "EXPANDED tree, which does contain real, renderable leaves. (Caught by"
        "re-reading the composite source itself, not just grepping sample-"
        "node's case list for the top-level component id -- the same"
        "discovery is what revealed :vfx/humanoid-marker is STILL dead despite"
        "ALSO being a real, reachable composite: its own only child,"
        ":vfx/model-marker, has no sample-node case either, confirmed via"
        "grep -- see teleport_marker.edn's own docstring, unchanged from this"
        "pass's first draft.)"
        ""
        ":vfx/arc-field (the composite's OWN internal reference, not the"
        "ability-level file's) has no sample-node case -- confirmed-dead class,"
        "dropped along with every field only it read. The composite's fade-"
        "wrapped :vfx/ring uses a plain scalar :ring-radius (not a {:from :to}"
        "map), so no lerp translation is needed here, unlike ring_fade_audio.edn."]
 :schema-version 2
 :kind :vfx/system
 :asset/type :vfx/system
 :asset/version 1
 :id :beam-arc-fade
 :revision 1
 :lifecycle :transient
 :inputs
 {:spawn {:start :vec3 :end :vec3
          :duration-ticks :int :beam-at :int :grow-ticks :int
          :layers :any :arc-at :int :arc-spacing :any
          :arc-radius :any :arc-count-limit :int :arc-life-ticks :int
          :fade-at :int :fade-from-tick :int :fade-to-tick :int
          :fade-from-alpha :float :fade-to-alpha :float
          :ring-radius :any :ring-segments :int :ring-color :any}}
 :state-slots {:age :float :seed :int}
 :scene
 "{:ability :beam-arc-fade
   :do [(when (math/gte ?age ?beam-at)
          (beam {:start ?start :end ?end :grow-ticks ?grow-ticks :layers ?layers}))
        (when (math/gte ?age ?fade-at)
          (let fade-p (math/clamp
                       (math/div (math/sub ?age ?fade-from-tick)
                                (math/max 1.0 (math/sub ?fade-to-tick ?fade-from-tick)))
                       0.0 1.0))
          (let fade-alpha (math/lerp ?fade-from-alpha ?fade-to-alpha fade-p))
          (ring {:center ?end :radius ?ring-radius :segments ?ring-segments
                :color ?ring-color :alpha fade-alpha}))
        (finish {:outcome :performed})]}"}
